# ── Node / npm ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
